OL,3,GNEWSANew multi-sport venue opens its
OL,4,Adoors
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new multi-use sports facility which
OL,7,Fwill offer some free access for people
OL,8,Fliving in the community has opened.
OL,10,FPlayZone, which is located on Roval
OL,11,FDrive in Immingham, is the third of its
OL,12,Fkind to be built in North East
OL,13,FLincolnshire in the past two years.
OL,15,FIt includes a 30m by 20m (98ft by 66ft)
OL,16,Fpitch, basketball hoops, benches,
OL,17,Fgoals, fencing and LED floodlighting to
OL,18,Fallow year-round use.
