OL,6,FCouncillor Bob Callison, portfolio
OL,7,Fholder for environment, culture and
OL,8,Ftourism said: "It's important that
OL,9,Fpeople have spaces to come to and use
OL,10,Fhowever they want ` that freedom is
OL,11,Fessential in keeping people active.
OL,12,FThis is a great addition to the town
OL,13,Fand I've no doubt it'll be well used."
